{"text":"As much as I have lived an experience to your graduates of today, what you will know and what you do will far exceed it. History, it seems, is speeding up. After graduation, you lead the relative security of predictability and certainty of these wars for a world full of accelerated uncertainties. Across the globe, entire societies are being transformed, new identities forged, and national stories retold. People your age across the world are becoming increasingly vocal about how they are governed and by whom. All templates of control have been overturned as states struggle internally with issues of our national character and destiny. People who heretofore had no say in those conversations are asserting themselves and taking a place at the table with or without invitation.","words":[{"text":"As","start":0.0,"end":1.08},{"text":"much","start":1.08,"end":1.4},{"text":"as","start":1.4,"end":3.02},{"text":"I","start":3.02,"end":3.22},{"text":"have","start":3.22,"end":3.38},{"text":"lived","start":3.38,"end":3.6},{"text":"an","start":3.6,"end":3.8},{"text":"experience","start":3.8,"end":4.52},{"text":"to","start":4.52,"end":5.44},{"text":"your","start":5.44,"end":5.58},{"text":"graduates","start":5.58,"end":6.04},{"text":"of","start":6.04,"end":6.28},{"text":"today","start":6.28,"end":6.68,"punct":","},{"text":"what","start":7.98,"end":8.74},{"text":"you","start":8.74,"end":8.98},{"text":"will","start":8.98,"end":9.16},{"text":"know","start":9.16,"end":9.52},{"text":"and","start":9.52,"end":11.16},{"text":"what","start":11.16,"end":11.34},{"text":"you","start":11.34,"end":11.54},{"text":"do","start":11.54,"end":12.4},{"text":"will","start":12.4,"end":13.18},{"text":"far","start":13.18,"end":13.66},{"text":"exceed","start":13.66,"end":14.24},{"text":"it","start":14.24,"end":15.72,"punct":"."},{"text":"History","start":15.98,"end":16.72,"punct":","},{"text":"it","start":16.84,"end":16.94},{"text":"seems","start":16.94,"end":17.38,"punct":","},{"text":"is","start":17